    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d512">

                <pb facs="0629" n="535" xml:id="pg535"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">702.1211 Laredo/54: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Governor of Texas</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Moody</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Austin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-01-16">January 16, 1930</date>.<lb/>[Received 1:55
                        p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your wire. Consul General at San Antonio has issued statement that Consulate at
                    Laredo will be opened Friday. I want to express appreciation which I feel and
                    which the citizens of Laredo feel for your efficient assistance in this
                    matter.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dan Moody</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
